; The triangle form fails at the canvas :shape slot because its head is
; not in shape-form's HeadSet. The walker also descends into (triangle …)
; and emits unknown_form because triangle is not a declared form. Both
; diagnostics are expected, in order.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code not_head_member :path [canvas shape])
  (diagnostic :code unknown_form :path [canvas shape triangle]))
